---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { openingClashes, toeTheories, TOE_ARENA_UPDATED } from "../../data/toe-arena";

const tiers = ["S", "A", "B", "C", "D", "F"] as const;
const contenders = toeTheories.filter((theory) => theory.kind === "contender");
const exhibitions = toeTheories.filter((theory) => theory.kind !== "contender");
---

<PageLayout
  title="ToE Arena | Franklin Baldo"
  description="Uma arena viva para teorias de tudo: tiers com evidência, confrontos explícitos e histórico de promoção e rebaixamento."
  lang="pt"
>
  <main class="arena-shell">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">TEMPORADA 01 · ATUALIZADA {TOE_ARENA_UPDATED}</p>
      <h1>ToE Arena</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Teorias de tudo entram aqui para brigar — mas a brincadeira termina onde começa a evidência.
        O tier científico mede maturidade e contato com física estabelecida. O tier de interesse mede
        quão fértil, estranha ou generativa é a ideia. <strong>S não significa “verdade”.</strong>
      </p>
      <div class="hero-notes">
        <span>🥊 confrontos por critério</span>
        <span>↕ promoções só com mudança material</span>
        <span>🧾 fontes em cada ficha</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="ranking-heading">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">RANKING CIENTÍFICO</p>
          <h2 id="ranking-heading">A liga</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Primeira temporada propositalmente sem campeão S.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="tier-board">
        {tiers.map((tier) => {
          const entries = contenders.filter((t) => t.scientificTier === tier);
          return (
            <section class={`tier-row tier-${tier.toLowerCase()}`} aria-label={`Tier ${tier}`}>
              <div class="tier-letter" aria-hidden="true">{tier}</div>
              <div class="tier-content">
                {entries.length === 0 ? (
                  <p class="empty-tier">vazio — ninguém ganhou esse lugar ainda</p>
                ) : (
                  <div class="cards">
                    {entries.map((theory) => (
                      <article class="theory-card">
                        <div class="card-topline">
                          <span class="science-badge">científico {theory.scientificTier}</span>
                          <span class="interest-badge">interesse {theory.interestTier}</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>{theory.name}</h3>
                        <p>{theory.summary}</p>
                        <details>
                          <summary>Ver ficha de evidência</summary>
                          <div class="evidence-grid">
                            <div>
                              <h4>O que sustenta</h4>
                              <ul>{theory.strengths.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                              <h4>O que segura</h4>
                              <ul>{theory.openProblems.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          {theory.note && <p class="note">{theory.note}</p>}
                          <p class="source-line">
                            Fonte: <a href={theory.sourceUrl}>{theory.sourceLabel}</a>
                            {theory.sourceDate && <> · {theory.sourceDate}</>}
                            <> · confiança: {theory.confidence}</>
                          </p>
                        </details>
                      </article>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
            </section>
          );
        })}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="clashes-heading">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">CLASHES</p>
          <h2 id="clashes-heading">Onde elas realmente discordam</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Sem “vencedor geral”: cada luta escolhe um gargalo concreto.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="clash-grid">
        {openingClashes.map((clash, index) => (
          <article class="clash-card">
            <span class="round">ROUND {String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
            <h3>{clash.title}</h3>
            <p class="battleground">{clash.battleground}</p>
            <p>{clash.body}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="exhibition-heading">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">EXHIBITION</p>
          <h2 id="exhibition-heading">Ideias adjacentes da casa</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Podem entrar na conversa sem fingir que são uma ToE.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="exhibition-list">
        {exhibitions.map((theory) => (
          <article class="exhibition-card">
            <div>
              <span class="nr">NR · não ranqueada cientificamente</span>
              <h3>{theory.name}</h3>
              <p>{theory.summary}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="exhibition-meta">
              <span>interesse {theory.interestTier}</span>
              <a href={theory.sourceUrl}>abrir paper ↗</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rules" aria-labelledby="rules-heading">
      <p class="kicker">REGRAS DA ARENA</p>
      <h2 id="rules-heading">Como alguém sobe de tier?</h2>
      <div class="rule-grid">
        <article><strong>01</strong><span>nova evidência empírica ou nova restrição observacional</span></article>
        <article><strong>02</strong><span>um problema central resolvido de forma verificável</span></article>
        <article><strong>03</strong><span>cálculo ou reprodução independente relevante</span></article>
        <article><strong>04</strong><span>uma contradição demonstrada também pode rebaixar</span></article>
      </div>
      <p class="fineprint">
        Popularidade, branding e “parece elegante” não movem tier científico. Uma teoria nova pode ter
        interesse S e ciência C sem qualquer contradição. A arena será atualizada pela rotina diária de
        descoberta e confronto.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .arena-shell {
    --ink: var(--pico-color);
    --muted: var(--pico-muted-color);
    --paper: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pico-background-color) 88%, var(--pico-primary) 12%);
    --line: var(--pico-muted-border-color);
    --panel: var(--pico-card-background-color, var(--pico-background-color));
    --panel-soft: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pico-background-color) 94%, var(--pico-primary) 6%);
    --accent-gold: #f5d547;
    --accent-interest: #e8e0ff;
    --accent-science: #f5e4a3;
    --inverse: var(--pico-background-color);
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .arena-shell {
    --paper: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pico-background-color) 88%, #7d6a20 12%);
    --panel: var(--pico-card-background-color, #211c17);
    --panel-soft: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pico-background-color) 90%, #8a7440 10%);
    --accent-gold: #d8b93f;
    --accent-interest: #342d4a;
    --accent-science: #493f24;
    --inverse: #fff9e8;
  }
  .hero {
    margin: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0 clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-large);
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-gold) 0 16%, transparent 16%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, var(--paper), var(--panel));
    box-shadow: var(--elevation-card);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .eyebrow, .kicker, .round { font: 800 .75rem/1.1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hero h1 {
    margin: .35rem 0 .9rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 12vw, 8.4rem);
    line-height: .82;
    letter-spacing: -.075em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .lede { max-width: 780px; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.4rem); line-height: 1.45; }
  .hero-notes { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .hero-notes span {
    padding: .48rem .75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--panel) 88%, transparent);
    font-size: .82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 2rem; margin: 4rem 0 1rem; }
  .section-heading h2, .rules h2 { margin: .15rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .section-heading > p { max-width: 360px; color: var(--muted); text-align: right; }
  .tier-board {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-large);
    box-shadow: var(--elevation-soft);
  }
  .tier-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 82px 1fr; min-height: 100px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .tier-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .tier-letter { display: grid; place-items: center; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 950; }
  .tier-s .tier-letter { background: #f2bd2f; } .tier-a .tier-letter { background: #f3d86e; } .tier-b .tier-letter { background: #c7df9d; } .tier-c .tier-letter { background: #abd7cf; } .tier-d .tier-letter { background: #c9c1df; } .tier-f .tier-letter { background: #dfb1a3; }
  .tier-content { padding: 1rem; background: var(--panel-soft); }
  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .theory-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-medium);
    padding: 1.05rem;
    background: var(--panel);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px -26px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
  }
  @media (hover: hover) {
    .theory-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--elevation-soft);
    }
  }
  .theory-card h3, .clash-card h3, .exhibition-card h3 { margin: .6rem 0; font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.05; }
  .theory-card > p, .clash-card > p, .exhibition-card p { color: var(--pico-color); line-height: 1.5; }
  .card-topline { display: flex; gap: .4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .science-badge, .interest-badge, .nr { display: inline-block; padding: .25rem .45rem; border: 1px solid var(--ink); font: 700 .7rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .interest-badge { background: var(--accent-interest); } .science-badge { background: var(--accent-science); }
  details { margin-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); padding-top: .7rem; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 800; }
  .evidence-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-top: .8rem; }
  .evidence-grid h4 { margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  .evidence-grid ul { margin-top: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .evidence-grid li { margin-bottom: .4rem; line-height: 1.35; }
  .note { padding: .7rem; background: var(--paper); }
  .source-line { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .empty-tier { margin: 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }
  .clash-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .clash-card {
    min-height: 250px;
    padding: 1.35rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-medium);
    background: var(--panel-soft);
    box-shadow: var(--elevation-card);
  }
  .battleground { display: inline-block; padding: .25rem .45rem; background: var(--ink); color: var(--inverse) !important; font: 700 .72rem/1.3 ui-monospace, monospace; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .exhibition-list { display: grid; gap: .8rem; }
  .exhibition-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: end;
    padding: 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-medium);
    background: var(--panel);
  }
  .exhibition-meta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; align-items: end; white-space: nowrap; }
  .rules {
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    border-radius: var(--radius-large);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--ink), color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 88%, var(--pico-primary) 12%));
    color: var(--inverse);
    box-shadow: var(--elevation-card);
  }
  .rule-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1px; margin: 1.5rem 0; background: var(--pico-muted-border-color); }
  .rule-grid article { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .7rem; min-height: 150px; padding: 1rem; background: var(--ink); }
  .rule-grid strong { font-size: 2rem; color: var(--accent-gold); }
  .fineprint { max-width: 850px; color: var(--pico-muted-color); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero { box-shadow: var(--elevation-soft); }
    .section-heading { display: block; }
    .section-heading > p { text-align: left; }
    .tier-row { grid-template-columns: 55px 1fr; }
    .tier-letter { font-size: 2rem; }
    .evidence-grid, .clash-grid, .rule-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .exhibition-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .exhibition-meta { align-items: start; }
  }
</style>
